    <description>Created by: Elevation Solutions

When a Individual Application is created or updated and data exists in the fields for guardian information - this will look for existing guardians based on criteria and if found, stamps the lookup field on the application. If not found, creates the guardian account and stamps the Application lookup for the guardian fields.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Returns the submitted email, or a guaranteed non-matching string when blank.</description>
        <name>fxGuardian1_EmailForMatch</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  ISBLANK({!Get_Individual_Application.Parent_Guardian_1_Email__c}),
  &quot;NO_EMAIL_MATCH_&quot; &amp; {!recordId},
  {!Get_Individual_Application.Parent_Guardian_1_Email__c}
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Returns the submitted phone, or a guaranteed non-matching string when blank.</description>
        <name>fxGuardian1_PhoneForMatch</name>
